WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:04.890
- Hmm, some people are gonna
be really upset by this,

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:05.723
by the way.

00:00:07.011 --> 00:00:09.280
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:12.380
Hi, it's me again, Zac
Young, Pastry Director of

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:13.730
Craveable Hospitality Group.

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:16.950
I've been a professional
pastry chef for 13 years.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:20.673
Today, we're gonna taste
some Girl Scout cookies.

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:24.510
An iconic Girl Scout cookie.

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:27.400
The exterior doesn't really
give away the true magic

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.490
that's hidden inside.

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:31.263
Like many things in life,
the beauty is within.

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:34.600
Texture of the cookie is great.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:36.670
It has a subtle hint of mint.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:39.490
Too much mint and it
becomes like toothpaste.

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:41.710
My one problem is the outside coating.

00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:42.880
It's a little waxy.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:46.660
Like a mint-scented Yankee candle.

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:47.950
Four-and-a-half stars.

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:48.973
We're startin' high.

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:54.900
This is like when you get a
patch for wrestling a bear.

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:56.600
It's even better that it's edible.

00:00:57.670 --> 00:00:59.010
This is better than I remember.

00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:01.100
There's like a little bit
of saltiness in there,

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:02.210
and it's really crunchy.

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:03.630
These are actually really good.

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:04.670
She's a natural beauty.

00:01:04.670 --> 00:01:06.770
She doesn't wear make-up,
she just naturally glows.

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:07.603
I'm like into it.

00:01:07.603 --> 00:01:08.436
Four stars.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.240
Savannah Smiles, sounds like a drag queen.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:15.280
Oh, that's interesting.

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:16.320
Super crunchy.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:19.270
Crumbly on the inside,
super, super acidic.

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:21.690
You eat it, and like you
pucker and you do this thing,

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:24.060
and then when the sour goes
away, you finally smile.

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:26.100
And Savannah Smiles.

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:26.933
Two stars.

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:31.566
The Do-Si-Dos.

00:01:31.566 --> 00:01:33.800
The uglier cousin of the Nutter Butter.

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:36.163
Suspiciously lacking in filling.

00:01:37.010 --> 00:01:38.700
It's like peanut butter and chalk.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:39.550
It needs this.

00:01:39.550 --> 00:01:40.650
Peanut flavor is really good.

00:01:40.650 --> 00:01:42.850
I just want more cream filling.

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:44.100
I'm gonna go with three stars.

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:45.790
If you promise me a sandwich,

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:47.593
it better be heavy on the meat.

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:51.520
Oh, these are new.

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:53.200
The Girl Scout S'mores.

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:55.130
It doesn't really look like a s'more.

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:57.860
These look like those
sugar-free sandwich cookies

00:01:57.860 --> 00:01:59.060
that my grandmother had.

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:01.433
It's good.

00:02:01.433 --> 00:02:03.600
I'm not sure it's like s'mores.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:05.830
The cookie's good, basic,
chocolate is awesome.

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:07.150
I'm just missin' the toast.

00:02:07.150 --> 00:02:08.520
S'mores is the new girl.

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:09.610
I'm gonna be nice.

00:02:09.610 --> 00:02:12.033
I'm gonna give her three-and-a-half stars.

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:17.760
Tagalongs or Peanut Butter
Patties, depending on

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:18.720
where you live in the country.

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:20.093
I used to love these.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.370
Not as good as I remember.

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:23.500
I want more peanut butter.

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:24.333
I want more peanut.

00:02:24.333 --> 00:02:25.166
The chocolate's great.

00:02:25.166 --> 00:02:27.150
I'm just not getting the creaminess.

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:32.150
I want this to be the love
child of a peanut butter cup,

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:33.320
and a cookie.

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:35.810
It looks more like it's cookie father

00:02:35.810 --> 00:02:37.870
and it definitely needs milk.

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:39.020
Three-and-a-half stars.

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:41.760
Three-and-three-quarters stars.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:43.040
It's like one of those
things that are maybe

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:44.663
best kept as a memory.

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:49.910
Wow, they look artisanal.

00:02:49.910 --> 00:02:51.760
Gluten-free, Girl Scout cookies.

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:54.137
Next year, they're gonna be
selling kale and quinoa salad.

00:02:54.137 --> 00:02:56.030
But no really, for people
who can't have gluten,

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:57.290
I'm actually really
happy that they did this.

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:58.720
This is the Toffee-Tastic.

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:00.340
Who names Girl Scout cookies?

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:01.603
How do I get that job?

00:03:02.481 --> 00:03:03.430
Mmm, the box don't lie.

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:06.470
It's toffee-tastic, super
crunchy, nicely carmelized,

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:07.390
really great flavor.

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:08.223
I'm into it.

00:03:08.223 --> 00:03:09.310
Good three-and-a-half stars.

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:12.120
The only thing missing in
here is a lot more toffee.

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.220
I wanna crack a tooth.

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:19.840
Yes, it's like a thing of beauty.

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:23.910
The texture, the toasted coconut, halo.

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:27.250
Toasty, coconutty, hint of suntan lotion,

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:28.870
in the best possible way.

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:32.400
Gooey, chewy, probably the
only Girl Scout cookie,

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:33.970
that I can't make better.

00:03:33.970 --> 00:03:34.803
Five stars.

00:03:34.803 --> 00:03:37.073
Because you can never
replicate perfection.

00:03:37.073 --> 00:03:39.120
Where's the rest of this box?

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:41.440
There's like winter, spring, summer, fall,

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:42.800
and Girl Scout cookie season.

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:43.880
That's my favorite season.

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:44.730
They're nostalgic.

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:46.080
There isn't a bad one.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:47.810
Go support your local Girls Scouts.

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:52.610
Buy as many boxes as you can,
because no one can say no

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:53.770
to Girl Scout cookies.

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:56.750
I used to hide these under
my bed, like other boys

00:03:56.750 --> 00:04:00.240
had filthy magazines, I had
boxes of Girl Scout cookies.

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:01.523
Go figure.

00:04:01.523 --> 00:04:04.106
(upbeat music)

